VOID — 2026-08-03. This sidecar certifies a document that NO LONGER EXISTS.

It hashed an 11,477 B draft written at 20:57:28 and superseded within the hour for cause. The
causes are recorded in the SUPERSESSION NOTICE at the head of the replacement PREREG_slope.md and
are not repeated here, except the one that mattered: that draft's -5 deg arm would have run
UPHILL, because it never checked the gravity sign in H0914M_DN5.osim, which carries the uphill
value while bearing the downhill name.

Retained rather than deleted, because a hash sidecar with no document is exactly the artifact this
project catalogues: a receipt for a thing nobody kept. Renaming it VOID_ is the disposition; the
hash below is left intact so anyone holding a copy of the superseded draft can confirm which
document this refers to.
